      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAGIC DEUCE (5) has some solid form under his belt and proved too strong last time to win by 6 lengths at this track in a handy 19.86 beating Satoshi. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. TRUE HORNET (2) missed the frame latest but had been racing well prior to that including a Restricted WIN win two back (20.11) at this track. Can turn it around this time. HARA'S LOKI (3) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing sixth (20.07) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Form at the trip sound including three wins. Goes well out of this box with a win and five minor placings. Likely to play a prominent role. MORRISETTE (1) can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
